<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">ubaitotte tsukandatte</font></b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">even if I take it back, and grasp it</font></b></font></font></font>

32
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kimi janai nara</font></b></font></font></font>

33
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you're not the one</font></b></font></font></font>

34
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like your determination!</font>

39
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

40
00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For those who are still here...</font>

41
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first test...</font>

42
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have passed it!</font>

43
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've passed through the gates!</font>

44
00:01:57,970 --> 00:02:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first test for the Chunin Exams
has been completed...</font>

45
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish you well.</font>

46
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:08,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Wish us well!</font>

47
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a funny guy...</font>

48
00:02:33,170 --> 00:02:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...</font>

49
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think that there would be
a guy who would pass the first test</font>

50
00:02:36,670 --> 00:02:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a blank test sheet.</font>

51
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto.
He really is a funny guy.</font>

52
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Second</font>

53
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Exam Starts!</font>

54
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Everyone Around</font>

55
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">us is an Enemy!</font>

56
00:03:19,970 --> 00:03:22,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something kind
of creepy about this place.</font>

57
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This place is called the Forest of Death,
you'll soon realize why.</font>

58
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:36,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The Forest of Death,
you'll soon realize why".</font>

59
00:03:36,230 --> 00:03:39,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kind of threat won't work
on me one bit!</font>

60
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not scared!</font>

61
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:43,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

62
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a lot of energy.</font>

63
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:57,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A kid like you dies at the very beginning,</font>

64
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">dappled with the red blood I like.</font>

65
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:12,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm returning your... Kunai Knife...</font>

66
00:04:13,390 --> 00:04:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for taking the trouble...</font>

67
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... don't stand behind me,
thirsty for blood.</font>

68
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want a quick death...</font>

69
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's my nature to act up
at the sight of red blood.</font>

70
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And my precious hair was cut,
so I got excited...</font>

71
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

72
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

73
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:53,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What with that Proctor?</font>

74
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Frankly, she's psycho!</font>

75
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one, too...</font>

76
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That girl, why was her tongue so long?</font>

77
00:05:03,610 --> 00:05:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently, we've got
a lot of hot-blooded kids this time.</font>

78
00:05:10,330 --> 00:05:11,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will be fun.</font>

79
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:15,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the most hot-blooded!</font>

80
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, before we start the second exam,
I have to pass this out to you!</font>

81
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a consent form,</font>

82
00:05:31,470 --> 00:05:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before you can take part
in the test you have to sign this.</font>

83
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:36,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

84
00:05:36,940 --> 00:05:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on out,
corpses are going to come out,</font>

85
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to get your consent to that!</font>

86
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or it'll be my responsibility.</font>

87
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:56,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm going to start
the explanation for the second exam.</font>

88
00:05:56,500 --> 00:06:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a word, the limits of
your survival will be challenged.</font>

89
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Survival, huh?
This test is a total pain.</font>

90
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:13,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, I'll give you step-by-step instruction
on the terrain of this Training Field.</font>

91
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Training Field Number 44 is surrounded
by 44 locked entrance gates,</font>

92
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are rivers and a forest
and a tower in the middle.</font>

93
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about 10 kilometers
from the towers to the gate...</font>

94
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this confined area, you will
go through a certain survival program.</font>

95
00:06:34,490 --> 00:06:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The contents of which are...</font>

96
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">anything goes scroll battle!</font>

97
00:06:44,590 --> 00:06:46,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">—Scroll...?
— Yes...</font>

98
00:06:47,670 --> 00:06:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to fight for two scrolls,
the Heaven Scroll and the Earth Scroll.</font>

99
00:06:57,520 --> 00:07:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All together 26 teams got
through the first test.</font>

100
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Half of them...</font>

101
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">13 teams get the Heaven scroll,
the other half get the Earth Scroll.</font>

102
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:11,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll hand over one scroll to each team.</font>

103
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To put it simply,
that's what you're vying for.</font>

104
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the conditions to pass?</font>

105
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three of you bring both the Heaven and
Earth Scrolls to the tower in the center.</font>

106
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:29,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means that of the 13 teams,
half of them will fail for sure...</font>

107
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Except it has to be in time.</font>

108
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For this second exam,
the time limit is 120 hours.</font>

109
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it in exactly five days!</font>

110
00:07:38,430 --> 00:07:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five days.</font>

111
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do we do about food?</font>

112
00:07:41,230 --> 00:07:44,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be self-sufficient! It's a treasure trove
in the wilderness.</font>

113
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's more than enough for food...</font>

114
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

115
00:07:48,690 --> 00:07:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's teeming with
fierce people-eating animals,</font>

116
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">poison bugs, poisonous weeds and
much more.</font>

117
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...</font>

118
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool, that's why it's called survival!</font>

119
00:07:59,410 --> 00:08:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, it's improbable that 39 people,
13 teams will pass.</font>

120
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:08,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The interval for activity gets longer
with passing each day,</font>

121
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:11,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">while the time for recovery
gets shorter...</font>

122
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems pretty grueling!</font>

123
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:18,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of that, you're surrounded
by nothing but enemies,</font>

124
00:08:18,310 --> 00:08:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even falling asleep
will be a problem...</font>

125
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, besides those injured
during attempts to capture scrolls...</font>

126
00:08:25,730 --> 00:08:30,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there will definitely be people that are unable to endure the rigors of the course.</font>

127
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm... so you can quit in the middle of it?</font>

128
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:38,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to the rules,
you cannot give up in the middle of it!</font>

129
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to spend
five days in the forest.</font>

130
00:08:42,710 --> 00:08:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like I thought...</font>

131
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is going to be a pain!</font>

132
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moving on, conditions of disqualification.</font>

133
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Number 1, if all three members
of the team can't make it to the tower</font>

134
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Heaven and Earth Scrolls
within the time limit.</font>

135
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Number 2, if a team loses a member
or if a member became incapacitated.</font>

136
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's that, and this is a supplement...</font>

137
00:09:08,690 --> 00:09:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Absolutely do not look at
the contents of the scrolls</font>

138
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until you have reached the tower!</font>

139
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What happens if we look
at it halfway through?</font>

140
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you look at it you'll find... out!</font>

141
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

142
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:29,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are times when a Chunin
must deal with super-secret text.</font>

143
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is to test your reliability.</font>

144
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all the explanation!</font>

145
00:09:33,590 --> 00:09:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll exchange your three consent forms for
the scrolls in that hut over there.</font>

146
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that, pick your entrance,
and all the gates will open simultaneously!</font>

147
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:47,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finally, just a word of advice...</font>

148
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't die!</font>

149
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, so you won't know which
scroll was given to each team...</font>

150
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you won't know which of
the three people is carrying the scroll.</font>

151
00:10:25,890 --> 00:10:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If what Ibiki said was right,</font>

152
00:10:27,890 --> 00:10:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there will be life or death
struggles for information in this test.</font>

153
00:10:34,230 --> 00:10:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone is an enemy!</font>

154
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The resolve of everyone here is strong.</font>

155
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means that it might come
to killing each other.</font>

156
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:50,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like they understand the meaning
of the consent form a little bit...</font>

157
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, look who's here!</font>

158
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Billboard Brow, isn't it?</font>

159
00:11:01,430 --> 00:11:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you went home long ago,
I never imagined you were still here.</font>

160
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh? Look who's here,
the ugly Ino Pig.</font>

161
00:11:11,690 --> 00:11:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Starting now, it's five days of
the survival test with Sasuke-kun.</font>

162
00:11:15,570 --> 00:11:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no reason to go home.</font>

163
00:11:21,490 --> 00:11:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ugly!
— Billboard!</font>

164
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ugly! Ugly!
— Billboard! Billboard!</font>

165
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:24,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ugly, ugly, ugly!
— Billboard, billboard, billboard!</font>

166
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Billboard, billboard, billboard!
— Ugly, ugly, ugly!</font>

167
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ugly, ugly, ugly, ugly!
— Billboard, billboard, billboard, billboard!</font>

168
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, this is impossible for you.</font>

169
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For your own sake,
just hurry up and go home!</font>

170
00:11:33,830 --> 00:11:35,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could say the exact same thing to you!</font>

171
00:11:42,930 --> 00:11:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, why are those two
on such bad terms?</font>

172
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Do you think I care about
something stupid like that?</font>

173
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man... all there is to do
is write my name,</font>

174
00:11:55,690 --> 00:11:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why does it take this much time!</font>

175
00:11:59,650 --> 00:12:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hinata! What are you
doing over there?</font>

176
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:05,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto-kun...</font>

177
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm... uhhhh... well...</font>

178
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like I thought,
this kid is strange.</font>

179
00:12:14,290 --> 00:12:15,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A scratch...</font>

180
00:12:15,290 --> 00:12:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-um... this... is...</font>

181
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:19,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See ya!</font>

182
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:26,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

183
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time for
the scroll exchange.</font>

184
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:46,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I wonder how
many teams will survive...</font>

185
00:12:59,590 --> 00:13:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Teams who have
taken the scroll,</font>

186
00:13:01,420 --> 00:13:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stay with the representative
and move to the gate!</font>

187
00:13:04,590 --> 00:13:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll all start simultaneously
in 30 minutes!!</font>

188
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:22,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Survival is our forte!</font>

189
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, don't show your weakness.</font>

190
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, okay...</font>

191
00:13:27,610 --> 00:13:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Life or death...</font>

192
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pain but we just have to do this.</font>

193
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this,
Naruto will be our target.</font>

194
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For snacks, there's potato chips...</font>

195
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:39,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What about shortcake...?
— I can't believe you two!</font>

196
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I won't lose!</font>

197
00:13:43,710 --> 00:13:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring down whoever comes near me.</font>

198
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes!
— Shannaro!</font>

199
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh heh... finally the opportunity is here...</font>

200
00:13:58,020 --> 00:14:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have the chance to fulfill
our mission in earnest...</font>

201
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:09,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure, the enemy teams are scary but,</font>

202
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:13,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm really scared of spending
five days with this guy.</font>

203
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Target the rookies first.</font>

204
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They said that from now on
it's okay to kill,</font>

205
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which makes it easier.</font>

206
00:14:25,590 --> 00:14:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei, I'll do my best!
I'll definitely succeed!</font>

207
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We now start the second
test of the Chunin Exam!</font>

208
00:14:53,370 --> 00:14:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look for the brats!</font>

209
00:14:54,830 --> 00:14:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those three, right?</font>

210
00:14:58,620 --> 00:15:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go!</font>

211
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! First, we search for that thing.</font>

212
00:15:13,850 --> 00:15:15,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you do it, Hinata?</font>

213
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

214
00:15:19,730 --> 00:15:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

215
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slow down, Lee!
We just started.</font>

216
00:15:27,570 --> 00:15:29,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know. But...</font>

217
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stay still!</font>

218
00:15:33,030 --> 00:15:35,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows what kind of
powerful foe is waiting for us.</font>

219
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:38,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hot-blooded fool...</font>

220
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you already understand,
we have only one target!</font>

221
00:15:57,970 --> 00:16:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you doing, Choji?</font>

222
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little break...
I'm already tired, and hungry...</font>

223
00:16:07,110 --> 00:16:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you suddenly saying?!</font>

224
00:16:10,190 --> 00:16:12,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It hasn't been five minutes
since we started!</font>

225
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:16,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I can't help it. I'm hungry...</font>

226
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:20,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! If you were able to bring snacks,</font>

227
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should have been able
to bring one Kunai knife!</font>

228
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:25,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino! Hide!</font>

229
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-oh!</font>

230
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:55,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kind of thing continuing
for five days...?</font>

231
00:17:04,670 --> 00:17:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, the tower is the
goal for everyone, right?</font>

232
00:17:09,170 --> 00:17:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it would be clever for us to make
a trap in the vicinity of the tower.</font>

233
00:17:14,380 --> 00:17:17,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... wasting no time, huh?</font>

234
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:18,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are they?</font>

235
00:17:20,970 --> 00:17:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... kids.</font>

236
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like begging to be found,
standing in that conspicuous place.</font>

237
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They sensed our presence,</font>

238
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but, evidently they haven't
grasped where we are.</font>

239
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?
You're pale.</font>

240
00:17:39,740 --> 00:17:41,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is that?!</font>

241
00:17:51,710 --> 00:17:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Flying Leeches of Leaf Village
sense body temperature and perspiration,</font>

242
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then in mass, swoop down
on their prey.</font>

243
00:17:57,970 --> 00:18:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they continue to suck
your blood for five minutes,</font>

244
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you go to the other world...</font>

245
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Using this behavior,</font>

246
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'd set a trap on the path
enemies would use to escape.</font>

247
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:09,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn it...</font>

248
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's one team gone!</font>

249
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It sounds like they've already started.</font>

250
00:18:32,250 --> 00:18:34,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasn't that someone screaming
just now?</font>

251
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm kinda getting nervous.</font>

252
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:47,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It was nothing. Sakura-chan.</font>

253
00:18:50,150 --> 00:18:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I have to pee...</font>

254
00:18:53,150 --> 00:18:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You... fool!</font>

255
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:57,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing
in front of a lady!</font>

256
00:18:57,940 --> 00:18:59,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to the grass!</font>

257
00:19:05,870 --> 00:19:09,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ahhh, that was a lot!
I'm refreshed.</font>

258
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said, not in front of a lady...!</font>

259
00:19:18,510 --> 00:19:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke-kun... no matter what,
you don't have to go that far.</font>

260
00:19:23,350 --> 00:19:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What was that for...?</font>

261
00:19:35,610 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing... all of a sudden?!</font>

262
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you ask? That's my line, isn't it?</font>

263
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

264
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped!</font>

265
00:19:57,250 --> 00:19:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, please stop!</font>

266
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:01,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look closely at him!</font>

267
00:20:04,390 --> 00:20:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Talk! Where's the real Naruto!</font>

268
00:20:08,100 --> 00:20:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no idea what
you're talking about!</font>

269
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to the scratch
on you face?</font>

270
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm asking what happened to the scratch
you got before from the Proctor!</font>

271
00:20:20,070 --> 00:20:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And your Shuriken holster
is on your left leg.</font>

272
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy's right handed!</font>

273
00:20:27,950 --> 00:20:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're worse at transformation
than Naruto, you phony!</font>

274
00:20:34,670 --> 00:20:38,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlucky! You got me.
In that case...</font>

275
00:20:39,090 --> 00:20:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one of you got the scroll?</font>

276
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you listen to me obediently,
I'll spare your lives.</font>

277
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:57,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! Then I'll resort to force!</font>

278
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

279
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

280
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

281
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

282
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

283
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

284
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

285
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

286
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

287
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:43,380
